5.1
00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:29.687
Now read the ranking with its coverage. A route with a low

5.2
00:01:29.687 --> 00:01:33.662
known Red share can still have many unknown cells. When Red

5.3
00:01:33.662 --> 00:01:37.276
