5.4
00:01:37.276 --> 00:01:40.529
the tie. In this demonstration, every percentage and property

5.5
00:01:40.529 --> 00:01:44.143
value on screen is illustrative, so use the pattern of

5.6
00:01:44.143 --> 00:01:45.950
