6.1
00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:50.444
INCLUDED means eligible for the next evidence round. EXCLUDED

6.2
00:01:50.444 --> 00:01:55.082
candidates remain in the ranked pool, and can return after new

6.3
00:01:55.082 --> 00:01:58.876
