8.1
00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:33.573
After a completed One Round, the app reranks the full

8.2
00:02:33.573 --> 00:02:37.149
candidate pool. The next cutoff deactivates the chosen share

8.3
00:02:37.149 --> 00:02:41.122
of the previous nominal quota, with thirty-five percent as the

8.4
00:02:41.122 --> 00:02:44.698
